Error [jet.ErrInOptionalFallback]: `err` is not available in an optional fallback
  --> tests/ui/refutable_test_bind_optional.jet:3:45
    |
  3 | run: fn() { maybe() == .Val(value) ?? panic(err) }
    |                                             ^^^
 Why: An optional can be absent, but it has no failure report to name
